  "aboutFeatureMediaDesc": "Process audio tracks and video files seamlessly with synchronized output and high fidelity.",
  "aboutFeatureToolsTitle": "Audio Enhancement Suite",
  "aboutFeatureToolsDesc": "Built-in background noise reduction and loudness normalization for a polished listening experience.",
  "aboutTipsTitle": "Tips for Best Results",
  "aboutTip1": "Choose recordings where speech is clear and distinct from the musical accompaniment.",
  "aboutTip2": "High-bitrate, uncompressed source files produce substantially cleaner vocal separation.",
